import PortfolioLayout from "../../layouts/PortfolioLayout.astro";
---
<PortfolioLayout title="Projects" lang="zh" page="projects">
<main id="main" data-screen-label="Projects · 项目索引"><section class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">INDEPENDENT PROJECTS</span><h1>做出来，才算开始。</h1><p>一些独立工具、开源实验，以及它们在解决的问题。</p></div><div class="text-links"><a href="https://github.com/KKenny0?tab=repositories" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub 上的全部仓库 <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
<div class="filter-bar"><div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="项目分类"><button data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">全部</button><button data-filter="capture" aria-pressed="false">信息收集</button><button data-filter="think" aria-pressed="false">Agent 协作</button><button data-filter="make" aria-pressed="false">内容创作</button></div><label class="sort" for="sort">排序<select id="sort"><option value="stars">Stars 从高到低</option><option value="name">名称 A–Z</option></select></label></div>
<div class="collection"><div class="collection-main"><p class="collection-status" id="project-count" role="status">9 个项目 · 点击展开详情</p><div id="project-items">
<details class="project" id="videowipe" data-category="make" data-stars="51" data-name="VideoWipe" data-image="/assets/portfolio/focus/videowipe.jpg" data-image-alt="VideoWipe 视频检测与人工复核工作区" data-image-caption="工作区截图"><summary><div><strong>VideoWipe</strong><p>清除视频中烧录的字幕、水印与遮挡。</p></div><span class="stars" aria-label="51 stars">☆ 51</span><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="project-body"><p class="tagline">PYTHON · WEB UI · CLI</p><p>已经烧录进画面里的字幕和水印，会影响素材的再次使用。VideoWipe 将本地检测、人工复核与清理串成工作流，并提供 Python API、网页界面和命令行入口。</p><div class="text-links"><a href="https://github.com/KKenny0/videowipe" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看源码与使用说明 ↗</a></div></div></details>
<details class="project" id="obsidian-kami" data-category="make" data-stars="7" data-name="Kami Reader" data-image="/assets/portfolio/focus/kami.png" data-image-alt="Kami Reader 浅色 Obsidian 工作区" data-image-caption="浅色工作区截图"><summary><div><strong>Kami Reader</strong><p>把纸张的阅读感，带进 Obsidian。</p></div><span class="stars" aria-label="7 stars">☆ 7</span><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="project-body"><p class="tagline">OBSIDIAN THEME · LIGHT & DARK</p><p>为长时间阅读和写作设计的 Obsidian 主题。以暖纸色、墨蓝层级和衬线正文，让笔记回到内容本身，同时提供完整的浅色与深色外观。</p><img src="/assets/img/projects/kami-reading.webp" alt="Kami Reader 的 Obsidian 阅读界面" width="1456" height="1600" loading="lazy"><div class="text-links"><a href="https://github.com/KKenny0/obsidian-kami" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看主题与安装说明 ↗</a></div></div></details>
<details class="project" id="card-skill" data-category="make" data-stars="5" data-name="card-skill" data-image="/assets/portfolio/focus/card-skill.png" data-image-alt="card-skill 海报、封面与白板作品合集" data-image-caption="作品合集"><summary><div><strong>card-skill</strong><p>让内容成为经过检查的视觉作品。</p></div><span class="stars" aria-label="5 stars">☆ 5</span><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="project-body"><p class="tagline">CODEX + CLAUDE SKILL</p><p>从内容结构出发，制作海报、信息图、白板和阅读卡片。在生成流程里加入视觉检查，让排版与图像共同解释内容。</p><img src="/assets/img/projects/card-infograph.webp" alt="card-skill 生成的信息图作品" width="1441" height="1600" loading="lazy"><div class="text-links"><a href="https://github.com/KKenny0/card-skill" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看 Skill 与作品 ↗</a></div></div></details>
<details class="project" id="buddybar" data-category="think" data-stars="4" data-name="BuddyBar" data-image="/assets/portfolio/focus/buddybar.png" data-image-alt="BuddyBar 旧称 Claude Buddy 的状态栏展示图" data-image-caption="历史展示图 · 旧称 Claude Buddy"><summary><div><strong>BuddyBar</strong><p>住在 Claude Code 状态栏里的小伙伴。</p></div><span class="stars" aria-label="4 stars">☆ 4</span><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="project-body"><p class="tagline">CLAUDE CODE PLUGIN</p><p>长时间和 Agent 工作，也需要一点节奏感。BuddyBar 用状态栏里的虚拟宠物观察工作节奏，给出轻量提醒，并随着使用逐渐成长。</p><img src="/assets/img/projects/buddybar-demo.webp" alt="BuddyBar 在终端状态栏中的效果" width="1086" height="1448" loading="lazy"><div class="text-links"><a href="https://github.com/KKenny0/buddybar" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">认识 BuddyBar ↗</a></div></div></details>
<details class="project" id="clipplane" data-category="capture" data-stars="2" data-name="Clipplane" data-image="/assets/portfolio/focus/clipplane-store.png" data-image-alt="Clipplane 商店展示图中的剪藏弹窗" data-image-caption="商店展示图"><summary><div><strong>Clipplane</strong><p>把值得留下的那句话，先放回自己的电脑。</p></div><span class="stars" aria-label="2 stars">☆ 2</span><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="project-body"><p class="tagline">BROWSER EXTENSION · LOCAL FIRST</p><p>通过浏览器扩展与本地宿主，把选文收进 org-mode inbox，保留可查看的收集历史，再由使用者决定是否同步到 Notion 或 flomo。</p><div class="demo"><span class="label">试着留下这句话</span><blockquote id="demo-quote">好的工具，应该让想法回到你手里。</blockquote><div class="saved" id="demo-saved" hidden></div><div class="demo-actions"><button id="save-quote" type="button">收进来 ↗</button><button id="undo-quote" type="button" hidden>撤销收集</button></div><p id="demo-status" role="status">点击收集，看看一句话如何被留下。</p><small>交互示意，仅本页暂存，刷新后清空。</small></div><div class="text-links"><a href="https://github.com/KKenny0/Clipplane" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看真正的 Clipplane ↗</a></div></div></details>
<details class="project" id="tracework" data-category="capture" data-stars="2" data-name="Tracework" data-image="/assets/portfolio/focus/tracework.webp" data-image-alt="Tracework 从工作记录到进展报告的项目介绍图" data-image-caption="项目介绍图"><summary><div><strong>Tracework</strong><p>除了改了什么，也留下为什么这样做。</p></div><span class="stars" aria-label="2 stars">☆ 2</span><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="project-body"><p class="tagline">CODEX + CLAUDE PLUGIN</p><p>记录工作里的决定、被放弃的路径和风险边界。从会话捕获到带出处的决策查询，再到日报、周报与月度回顾，让后来的自己能沿着证据还原当时的判断。</p><img src="/assets/img/projects/tracework-site-crop.webp" alt="Tracework 项目展示" width="1240" height="760" loading="lazy"><div class="text-links"><a href="https://github.com/KKenny0/Tracework" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看 Tracework ↗</a></div></div></details>
<details class="project" id="taku" data-category="think" data-stars="1" data-name="Taku" data-image="/assets/portfolio/focus/taku.png" data-image-alt="Taku 六阶段工程工作流示意图" data-image-caption="工作流示意图"><summary><div><strong>Taku</strong><p>把工程习惯交给编码 Agent。</p></div><span class="stars" aria-label="1 star">☆ 1</span><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="project-body"><p class="tagline">AGENT SKILLS</p><p>将范围、证据与验证变成可复用的工作习惯，帮助编码 Agent 在复杂任务里保持意图清晰、上下文可控。</p><div class="text-links"><a href="https://github.com/KKenny0/Taku" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看 Taku ↗</a></div></div></details>
<details class="project" id="weave" data-category="think" data-stars="0" data-name="weave" data-image="/assets/portfolio/focus/weave.svg" data-image-alt="weave 项目标识" data-image-caption="项目标识 · 仓库暂无界面截图"><summary><div><strong>weave</strong><p>为一个问题，找到能解释它的框架。</p></div><span class="stars" aria-label="0 stars">☆ 0</span><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="project-body"><p class="tagline">RESEARCH SKILL</p><p>用三条不同的研究路线选择框架、检验论点，并组织有证据支撑的中文长文，同时保留来源、分歧与适用边界。</p><div class="text-links"><a href="https://github.com/KKenny0/weave" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看 weave ↗</a></div></div></details>
<details class="project" id="storyboard-prompter" data-category="make" data-stars="0" data-name="storyboard-prompter" data-image="/assets/portfolio/focus/storyboard.png" data-image-alt="storyboard-prompter 赛博朋克九格分镜示例" data-image-caption="分镜作品示例"><summary><div><strong>storyboard-prompter</strong><p>用明确约束，让分镜中的角色与动作连贯。</p></div><span class="stars" aria-label="0 stars">☆ 0</span><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><div class="project-body"><p class="tagline">CLAUDE CODE SKILL</p><p>为网格、共同美术方向、镜头节奏与动作物理建立约束，减少从一句想法到多格分镜时的角色漂移与动作错误。</p><img src="/assets/img/projects/storyboard-ink.webp" alt="storyboard-prompter 的分镜作品" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy"><div class="text-links"><a href="https://github.com/KKenny0/storyboard-prompter" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看分镜 Skill ↗</a></div></div></details>
</div><p class="snapshot-note">GitHub Stars 快照 · 2026.09.24 · 非实时数据</p></div>
